      "spec": [
        "5.3",
        "9.1",
        "D"
      ],
      "description": "An HTML block of only comments does not count as the first block, so an unknown data marker after it stands as the first block of a record without a title heading, and is feature-unsupported (§5.3, decisions Y3 and P6).",
